{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 62, :comments ["<b>Coming from Beer-Lahai-Roi.</b> To pray in the place where his handmaid's prayer was heard. And before he prayed, his matter had already been accomplished in Haran and his wife was near arrival, in the manner of טֶרֶם יִקְרָאוּ וַאֲנִי אֶעֱנֶה (Isaiah 65:24)." "<b>And he was dwelling in the land of the Negev.</b> Now Yitsḥak was dwelling to the south of Beer-Lahai-Roi, and he had not gone there then to establish his residence."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:32.910986791Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}